      "text": "BEFORE\nScan all 500M rows\nParallel workers reduce time, not I/O\n\nAFTER\nSpatial keys prune most rows\nBitmap scans fetch small candidate sets\nK-NN stops after the top 100\n\nRESULT\nSeconds become milliseconds",
      "rawText": "BEFORE\nScan all 500M rows\nParallel workers reduce time, not I/O\n\nAFTER\nSpatial keys prune most rows\nBitmap scans fetch small candidate sets\nK-NN stops after the top 100\n\nRESULT\nSeconds become milliseconds",
      "originalText": "BEFORE\nScan all 500M rows\nParallel workers reduce time, not I/O\n\nAFTER\nSpatial keys prune most rows\nBitmap scans fetch small candidate sets\nK-NN stops after the top 100\n\nRESULT\nSeconds become milliseconds",
